WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:06.000
Buying your first home can feel like a big step.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:10.140
It often begins before you have even found the right property.

00:00:11.060 --> 00:00:20.180
An adviser can help you understand what you may be able to borrow, based on your individual circumstances and lender criteria — and it helps to know that as you start looking.

00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:23.200
Mortgage Easy helps you get started.

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:27.880
You can explore in your own time or book a conversation when you are ready.

00:00:28.740 --> 00:00:34.900
That technology means your adviser already understands your situation and can focus on what matters most.

00:00:35.860 --> 00:00:41.020
When choosing a mortgage, your adviser will help you explore options that may suit your circumstances.

00:00:42.120 --> 00:00:44.740
They can also help you prepare for the next steps.

00:00:45.740 --> 00:00:49.900
When the time is right, your adviser can provide an Agreement in Principle.

00:00:50.920 --> 00:00:56.680
Although this is not a mortgage offer, it can help you move forward with more clarity when you are ready to make an offer.

00:00:57.140 --> 00:01:03.220
From your initial application to completion, your adviser works with your conveyancer and estate agent.

00:01:04.180 --> 00:01:07.780
And when you finally open the door to your new home, it is your moment.

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:09.400
Your journey.

00:01:10.600 --> 00:01:11.060
Made clearer.

00:01:12.300 --> 00:01:14.300
Understand what you may be able to borrow.

00:01:15.600 --> 00:01:17.540
Explore mortgage options with an adviser.

00:01:18.480 --> 00:01:20.200
Get your Agreement in Principle.

00:01:21.300 --> 00:01:22.820
Make your offer when you are ready.

00:01:23.900 --> 00:01:26.400
Move in — and talk about protecting what matters.
